        "line": 2768,
        "text": "theorem streamBeta_smul_direction {E : Type} [NormedAddCommGroup E] [NormedSpace ℝ E]\n    (r : ℝ) (w : E) (f : ℝ × E → ℝ) :\n    PressureStream.streamBeta (r • w) f = fun z => r • PressureStream.streamBeta w f z"
